{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_data_model", "label": "Mod\u00e8le de donn\u00e9es \u2014 Mini-ERP Charcuterie (v0.7)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_data_model_app_user", "label": "Entit\u00e9 app_user (compte d'acc\u00e8s, uuid, Identity)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nomm\u00e9e app_user et non user, mot r\u00e9serv\u00e9 PostgreSQL ; cl\u00e9 uuid align\u00e9e sur ASP.NET Core Identity."}, {"id": "docs_data_model_product", "label": "Entit\u00e9 product (code, name, sale_mode, allow_partial_sale, is_active)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "code et sale_mode d\u00e9finitifs apr\u00e8s cr\u00e9ation car le code porte le num\u00e9ro de lot ; allow_partial_sale rejet\u00e9 sur by_piece ; produit cr\u00e9able sur base vierge, aucun r\u00e9f\u00e9rentiel pr\u00e9alable."}, {"id": "docs_data_model_production_batch", "label": "Entit\u00e9 production_batch (batch_number, prix propre au lot, DLC, mati\u00e8re premi\u00e8re)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Prix au niveau du lot et non du produit ; product_id, production_date et batch_number d\u00e9finitifs car indissociables de l'identit\u00e9 du lot ; aucune suppression possible, ce qui permet de g\u00e9n\u00e9rer N par simple comptage."}, {"id": "docs_data_model_stock_unit", "label": "Entit\u00e9 stock_unit (objet physique individuel : batch_id, weight, status)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stock \u00e0 l'unit\u00e9 physique plut\u00f4t que compteur ; statut opened atteignable uniquement par vente partielle ; aucun num\u00e9ro stock\u00e9, le libell\u00e9 affich\u00e9 est le batch_number suffix\u00e9 du rang."}, {"id": "docs_data_model_customer", "label": "Entit\u00e9 customer (last_name, first_name, phone)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Suppression autoris\u00e9e seulement sans vente ; FK depuis sale en Restrict car SetNull effa\u00e7ait silencieusement la tra\u00e7abilit\u00e9 lot \u2194 client."}, {"id": "docs_data_model_sale", "label": "Entit\u00e9 sale (sale_number, customer_id obligatoire, date, paid, total calcul\u00e9)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cr\u00e9\u00e9e en une transaction avec ses lignes car une vente est un instant unique, contrairement au lot dont la pes\u00e9e s'\u00e9tale ; total calcul\u00e9 et non stock\u00e9 pour \u00e9viter toute divergence."}, {"id": "docs_data_model_stock_movement", "label": "Entit\u00e9 stock_movement (stock_unit_id, type, sold_weight, amount, sale_id)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le client n'est plus dupliqu\u00e9 ici : deux sources de v\u00e9rit\u00e9 divergent t\u00f4t ou tard, seul sale_id subsiste ; amount et sale_id uniquement pour type = sale ; modifiable et supprimable, choix assum\u00e9 pour une activit\u00e9 amateur."}, {"id": "docs_data_model_unit_of_measure", "label": "Entit\u00e9 unit_of_measure \u2014 supprim\u00e9e (2026-09-04)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le champ n'avait aucun effet sur le prix (RG-03 code le \u20ac/kg en dur) et bloquait la cr\u00e9ation du premier produit sur une base vierge ; sale_mode suffit \u00e0 piloter l'affichage."}, {"id": "docs_data_model_enum_sale_mode", "label": "Enum sale_mode (by_weight / by_piece)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_data_model_enum_stock_unit_status", "label": "Enum stock_unit_status (available, opened, sold, personal, lost)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_data_model_enum_movement_type", "label": "Enum movement_type (sale, personal, loss)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_data_model_batch_number_format", "label": "Format du num\u00e9ro de lot CODE-YYMMDD-N", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_data_model_sale_number_format", "label": "Format du num\u00e9ro de vente V-YYMMDD-N", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_data_model_correspondance_fr", "label": "Table de correspondance code anglais \u2194 affichage fran\u00e7ais", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_data_model_conventions_nommage", "label": "Conventions de nommage (anglais, snake_case, app_user, decimal)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_data_model_chaine_centrale", "label": "Cha\u00eene centrale product \u2192 production_batch \u2192 stock_unit \u2192 stock_movement \u2192 sale \u2192 customer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_data_model_couples_parent_enfant", "label": "Deux couples parent/enfant sym\u00e9triques (lot\u2192unit\u00e9s, vente\u2192lignes)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_data_model_statut_denormalise", "label": "Note d'architecture \u2014 le statut de l'unit\u00e9 physique est une d\u00e9normalisation assum\u00e9e", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_data_model_amount_stocke", "label": "Note d'architecture \u2014 le montant est stock\u00e9, pas recalcul\u00e9", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_data_model_points_extension", "label": "Points d'extension V2+ (mati\u00e8res premi\u00e8res, recettes versionn\u00e9es, r\u00f4les, alertes)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_data_model_index_recommandes", "label": "Index recommand\u00e9s", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/data-model.md", "sourc